    <string name="routines_enabled_desc">When off, commands from routines or shortcuts are not run. They are only recorded in the run history.</string>
    <string name="routines_how_title">How to set up</string>
    <string name="routines_step1">1. Settings → Modes and Routines → Routines → +</string>
    <string name="routines_step2">2. Condition: time, alarm dismissed, or another condition you want</string>
    <string name="routines_step3">3. Action: Apps → Open app or run app action → Bed Remote → ‘Move to Preset 2’ or ‘Stop bed’</string>
    <string name="routines_step4">4. Before a preset move, a large cancel screen appears. If you leave it alone, the bed moves.</string>
    <string name="routines_launcher_note">You can also long-press the app icon on the home screen to see the same shortcuts.</string>
